        "band_heading": "Unleash the Full Potential of Your RAM 2500 6th Gen in Australia",
        "band_background": "#000000",
        "band_text_color": "#56bdc2",
        "body": "<p>While the RAM 2500 6th Gen is an absolute powerhouse straight from the factory, adding heavy accessories, towing large trailers, or installing a custom tray and canopy can easily push you past Australia's strict road limits. An ORI GVM upgrade is the ultimate solution.</p><p>Offroad Industries (ORI) is a Federally Approved Second Stage Manufacturer (SSM) delivering the most comprehensive GVM upgrade packages available for the RAM 2500 6th Gen. Fully engineered and completely compliant with Australian Design Rules, our kits have you covered for both Pre-Rego (Federal) and Post-Rego (State-based) applications. Designed specifically to maximize the 6th Gen platform, our upgrades unlock massive payload capacity, elevate your suspension handling, and keep your rig 100% legal on the road.</p><p>Our packages are currently going through federal approval a with view to be approved September 2026. This only applies for Ram Australia delivered vehicles.</p>",
        "disclaimer": "",
        "style": "light",
